!! Legacy-Glyphs vocabulary

This tiddler's type is `text/vnd.tiddlywiki;vocab=Default,Legacy-Glyphs`. The three glyphs `´` `≈` `¶` were removed from Default in the cm-redesign and now live in the opt-in `Vocab/Legacy-Glyphs`.

!!! Tick (´) — inline mode, single-newline terminated

´foo legacy tick paragraph (the word `foo` is consumed as the symbol).

´.bigger A welcome line with class chain.

!!! Pilcrow (¶) — block, multi-level

¶pilcrow level 1.

¶¶pilcrow level 2.

¶¶¶pilcrow level 3.

!!! Approx (≈) — block, multi-level

≈approx level 1.

≈≈approx level 2.

!!! Gating check

When the same wiki text appears in a tiddler with plain `text/vnd.tiddlywiki`, none of these markers fire (the raw glyphs survive as text).
